                    <h5 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-brandBlue">— John D.</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="p-6 bg-brandGray rounded-xl shadow">
                    <p class="text-gray-600 italic">“The cognitive test highlighted areas I need to improve. I now have a roadmap for learning.”</p>
                    <h5 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-brandBlue">— Aisha K.</h5>
